sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant A as Server action
  participant T as sendTrackedEmail
  participant DB as D1
  participant M as Mailbox
  participant V as Recipient
  participant S as Inbound sync
  A->>T: record, recipients, body
  T->>T: pick sender
  T->>DB: reply thread + token
  T->>M: send (Reply-To has token)
  M->>V: email
  A->>DB: delivery, status, Activity
  V->>M: reply
  S->>M: every minute: new messages
  S->>DB: dedupe into inbound_emails
  alt token matches
    S->>DB: post on record thread
    S->>DB: Activity + notify staff
  else no token
    S->>DB: needs_review or routed
  end
